{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25784","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 肥河维舟阻冻袛待勅命 一 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 肥河维舟阻冻袛待勅命 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢分符竹作闲官，舟冻肥河拟棹难。\n食蘖苦心甘处困，饮冰持操敢辞寒。\n夜灯空应渔家火，朝食还依雁宿滩。\n西奏血诚遥稽首，乞容归病老江干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}